Package: ros.form.observe
Title: Populate Regional Observer Scheme Forms from ObServe Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Tony", "Chemit", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           email = "dev@tchemit.fr",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0007-1802-5256", URL = "https://ultreia.io"))
Description: Exports longline and purse-seine observer data from ObServe to
    Regional Observer Scheme (ROS) forms. The package writes one Excel workbook
    per trip and validates it against the requirements of the selected ROS form.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://ultreia-io.github.io/ros.form.observe/,
